but already for the primitive structure\hand{,} namely \inserted{by} choice of objects $D_i$ (\hand{$i\in\underline{N}$}
in M , and source and target maps $D_{\unsure{i}} \rightrightarrows D_{\unsure{i+1}}$ . These choices can be made
